[{"client_msg_id":"42EFA06E-B16F-4E8B-8279-5C00D847D51D","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"私はメインバンクSMBCで、証券口座もSMBCに揃えてNISA運用してましたが信託報酬が高いのが気になってSBIに移しました。","ts":"1618974274.162800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aFIxI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4086fae2-fb7e-485c-ac8d-30429a9d2cac","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"3月にSBI証券に口座作ったばかりですが、作った後に、SBIネット銀行の方から作っていれば5000円キャッシュバックキャンペーンがあると知ってぐぬぬ。\n\u003chttps://www.netbk.co.jp/contents/campaign/investment/sbisec-account/190801/\u003e","ts":"1618970964.161000","attachments":[{"fallback":"SBI証券口座開設優遇プログラム｜NEOBANK 住信SBIネット銀行","id":1,"title":"SBI証券口座開設優遇プログラム｜NEOBANK 住信SBIネット銀行","title_link":"https://www.netbk.co.jp/contents/campaign/investment/sbisec-account/190801/","text":"住信SBIネット銀行口座をお持ちのかたが新たにSBI証券口座開設や一定のお取引きをすることで現金をプレゼントする優遇プログラム。","blocks":null,"service_name":"netbk.co.jp","service_icon":"https://www.netbk.co.jp/contents/assets/img/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.netbk.co.jp/contents/campaign/investment/sbisec-account/190801/","original_url":"https://www.netbk.co.jp/contents/campaign/investment/sbisec-account/190801/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mnd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b299d85f-ef68-4d26-8534-052fdbd12f3b","type":"message","user":"US90LD360","text":"メインSBIで証券はSBIのハイブリッド口座使ってますが資金移動とか便利ですね。","ts":"1618967929.159000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b9c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71ea9b51-5503-41e6-9f14-b83e15a496e2","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"だからといって楽天証券とかはちょっと感はある\nSBIは(パスワードがちょっとアレだけど)他はいいかなと思う。SBIの銀行もわるくないし","ts":"1618967877.158700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BrQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc861482-e7df-4c58-b524-9ca1ec204ede","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"メガバンクメインはおすすめしないですね・・・単純に使いにくい","ts":"1618967760.157300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QdD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0c63fa8-c161-4a20-a5c1-9940831eddd5","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"とりあえずSMBC揃えのメリット調べてそんなでもなかったらSBI検討する感じになりますかね\nこの分野であまりジプシーやってもしょうがない感じがするのでビシっと決めたい","ts":"1618967758.157200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vP5W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b1237cc-9cc1-4ac8-99c1-4637809dae5a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"たとえば、SBIとかだと資金移動がラク(手数料、時間)がありますな\nある程度活発にやるとか、安全のために現金に戻すことを視野にいれるなら揃える(というか揃えたことによるサービスがあるところを選ぶ)といいかと思います。\n逆に、そこに着目しないなら、(例えば)つとめ先の会社がやってる年金をあつかう証券口座とそろえるという手もありますな。","ts":"1618967341.154500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ct3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58a6e1d8-52c7-4537-9faa-4ee4137add23","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"実際どれが取り回しいいのかが分からないので決めかねてる感じです","ts":"1618967234.152500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"61Vx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b5caed1-1773-425f-af5e-80ddbf3bd132","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"今後メインで運用する予定の口座が三井住友なのでそっちで作るか、手数料の安さと取り回し重視でSBIにするかで悩んでます\n知り合いが使ってるのもSBIなのでアドバイスの受けやすさの面でもSBIかな……","ts":"1618967195.152100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jtgd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"daaf3b08-0730-4d91-98b9-bf56cf841644","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"利便性をとるか手数料のやすさをとるか機能をとるか","ts":"1618966964.149900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EKvY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce855321-16e7-4374-9c85-1cd149f7646a","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"便利ではあるけど、何をもとめるかによりそう","ts":"1618966957.149500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AEbz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7082b43c-6003-44a2-b1b6-70c35ba6c07f","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"証券口座作ろうと思ってるんですけど、普通の預金口座と銀行揃えた方が便利とかそういうのありますかね？","ts":"1618964336.144600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wd8+"}]}]
